# EventRelay — Cursor/AI IDE Context Rules

## Vercel Documentation Reference
When answering questions about Vercel deployments, AI Gateway, or serverless functions,
reference the full Vercel docs: https://vercel.com/docs/llms-full.txt

## Project Context
- Frontend: Next.js 16 app in `apps/web/` deployed on Vercel
- Backend: Python/FastAPI deployed on Cloud Run at api.uvai.io
- AI Gateway: Vercel AI Gateway at ai-gateway.vercel.sh (key: AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY)
- MCP Servers: configured in `.gemini/settings.json`

## Key Conventions
- All LLM calls prefer Vercel AI Gateway when AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY is set
- Use `@ai-sdk/gateway` provider for AI SDK calls (streamText, generateText)
- Video generation uses `experimental_generateVideo` with model `google/veo-3.1-generate-001`
- Never use `dQw4w9WgXcQ` as test video ID; use `auJzb1D-fag`
- TypeScript strict mode; Python mypy strict
- Monorepo: root package.json manages workspaces under `apps/*`

## Vercel-Specific Patterns
- Root `vercel.json` handles all redirects, function config, and region settings
- `apps/web/vercel.json` only has framework/build config
- maxDuration for long-running routes set in root vercel.json `functions` block
- CSP and security headers configured in `next.config.js`
